WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.434
Welcome to Orbit. Finding the right words. Our focus is Verb patterns and meaning.

2
00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:17.826
An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity.

3
00:00:17.826 --> 00:00:21.615
She remembered to attach the report before sending.

4
00:00:21.615 --> 00:00:25.619
He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate.

5
00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:28.993
They managed to explain the problem clearly.

6
00:00:28.993 --> 00:00:38.391
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
